  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For last few days I and many of people I know are getting these errors \"vrchat is not responding\" for less than a second and then world is reloaded... when talking in group this happens so often its hard to do anything, as at least one person disconnects each 10 minutes\n\n\n2020.06.16 03:41:25 Log        -  [NetworkManager] OnDisconnected: ServerTimeout\n\n\n2020.06.16 03:41:25 Error      -  [VRCFlowNetworkManager] {{ NameServerAddress: 'ns.exitgames.com:5058', MasterServerAddress: '172.65.206.248:5055', GameServerAddress: '172.65.230.175:5056', Code: 'ServerTimeout', State: 'Disconnected', Time: '1350638.53' }}\n\n\n2020.06.16 03:41:25 Log        -  [VRCFlowNetworkManager] Disconnected: ServerTimeout with Reason: VRChat is not responding.\n\n\n2020.06.16 03:41:25 Log        -  [VRCFlowManagerVRC] Resetting game flow because \"VRChat is not responding.\": [RejoinInstance, SkipLogin]",
